  "description": "The Happy Wagon is a practical and comfortable electrically assisted machine that allows you to carry anything, everywhere! Built around an alluminium frame and Shimano’s new Step Cargo E6100 motor with a 504wh battery. Equipped with a 5-speed Shimano Nexus, Schwable tyres and hydraulic disc brakes. Featuring a rear lock, Creme grips with alloy bar ends and Supernova LED lights. Finished with a gloss paint in two colours, Black and White. The Happy Wagon is fitted with a dropper post for stability when the bike is stationary, allowing the rider to place their feet firmly on the ground when the bike comes to a stop. An adjustable stem makes the bike perfect for a wide range of rider sizes (from 150 cm to 190 cm). The bike can be used in various configurations – it can carry big loads or up to three small children in special seats. Larger children can also be transported directly on the rear platform. Additional accessories including footrests, racks, passenger handles, foot pegs, seat pads and pannier bags are available.",
